[EXAMPLES]
Set the Status field of record 0 to "done":

  recset -n 0 -f Status -S done todo.rec

Rename a field in all records:

  recset -f OldName -r NewName data.rec

Add a Tag field to records matching an expression:

  recset -e "Priority = 'high'" -f Tag -a urgent todo.rec

Delete a field from all records of a given type:

  recset -t Contact -f Notes -d contacts.rec

